WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.605
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:05.866
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:09.367
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:09.770
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:12.791
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:16.295
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:20.483
Select Training as the concept to match.

00:00:20.483 --> 00:00:25.457
Match it to the definition involving prediction error and parameter updates.

00:00:25.457 --> 00:00:29.472
Select Inference for the second pair.

00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:34.313
Match Inference to running a model with existing parameters.

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:38.278
Select Context for the final pair.

00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:41.571
Match Context to the information available during the current inference.

00:00:41.571 --> 00:00:46.732
Inspect the completed three-pair result and number of attempts.

00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:51.567
Restart the board to practise the pairs again.

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:55.567
Select Training again in the fresh board.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:01:00.471
Repeat the correct training match.

00:01:00.471 --> 00:01:07.232
Inspect the new round at one of three pairs completed.
